  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Hurrikan (German Scopa). 2-player, 32-40 card deck. Deal: 3 cards per player, 4 on table. Turn: Play card. Capture matching single card OR cards summing to card value (single match has priority). Hurrikan (empty table) = 1 bonus point. Scoring: Most cards (1), Most Hearts (1), Seven of Hearts (1), Hurrikan (1 each). Win: First to 16.',
    Player: "Welcome to Hurrikan, the German sweep game. Play a card from your hand to capture cards from the table. You can take a single card of equal value or multiple cards that sum to your card's value. Complete a 'Hurrikan' (sweep) by taking all cards from the tableâ€”that's a bonus point. Prioritize Hearts and the Seven of Hearts. First to 16 points wins.",
    objective: "Score 16 points by capturing cards and completing 'Hurrikans'.",
    gameplay: '1. On your turn, play one card from your hand. 2. Capture: If your card matches a card on the table, you take both. If your card matches the SUM of multiple cards on the table, you take all of them. 3. Priority: You MUST capture a single card of equal value before combining cards. 4. The Hurrikan (Sweep): If your capture leaves the table empty, you score 1 bonus point. 5. If you cannot capture, you must add your card to the table.',
    keyRules: [
      'You MUST capture a single card of equal value before combining cards',
      'The Hurrikan (Sweep): capturing all cards from the table scores 1 bonus point',
      'Scoring: Most cards (1 pt), Most Hearts (1 pt), Seven of Hearts (1 pt), Each Hurrikan (1 pt)',
      'First to 16 points wins the match',
    ],
